<title>POLAND: Espebepe Q2 loss improves to PLN 3.5 mln.</title>
<headline>Espebepe Q2 loss improves to PLN 3.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Espebepe preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating loss			 3.28   vs    4.86</p>
<p>    pre-tax loss			   3.42   vs    6.41</p>
<p>    net loss				 3.52   vs    6.42</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Espebepe Holding SA.</p>
<p>    net sales			     25.57   vs   27.10</p>
<p>    costs of sales			24.57   vs   26.85</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		   0.44   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    income tax			     0.10   vs    0.01</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   0.94   vs    0.66</p>
<p>    financial costs			0.64   vs    2.21</p>
<p>    investment			     0.15   vs    2.07</p>
<p>						H1 1997	H1 1996</p>
<p>    operating loss			 5.76   vs    3.47</p>
<p>    pre-tax loss			   6.04   vs    6.36</p>
<p>    net loss				 6.16   vs    6.38</p>
<p>    net sales			     47.79   vs   44.96</p>
<p>    costs of sales			46.11   vs   41.51</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		   0.44   vs    0.01</p>
<p>    income tax			     0.12   vs    0.01</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   1.05   vs    0.91</p>
<p>    financial costs			0.90   vs    3.80</p>
<p>    investment			     0.33   vs    2.07</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
